+    Use this subcommand to statically validate a local template directory
+    without rendering it. The configuration file, the questions, the
+    settings and the Jinja templates are checked for common mistakes; a
+    report is printed on standard output and the exit code signals whether
+    any error was found.
+    """
+
+    DESCRIPTION = "Validate a local template directory and report problems."
+    DESCRIPTION_MORE = dedent(
+        """\
+        The command never prompts, never clones remote sources and never
+        modifies the template. Findings are printed one per line, followed
+        by a summary line of the form ``N error(s) and M warning(s) found``.
+        The exit code is 1 when at least one error was found, and 0 when
+        the template only produced warnings (or nothing at all).
+        Usage errors, such as a path that is not a local directory, exit
+        with code 2 instead and skip the report entirely.
+        """
